@host = http://localhost:5080

### Hälsokoll (ingen databas)
GET {{host}}/healthz

### Vem är jag i databasen?
GET {{host}}/db/whoami

### Löstes Key Vault-referensen?
GET {{host}}/config

### Lista kunder
GET {{host}}/customers

### Skapa kund
POST {{host}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kalle Anka",
  "email": "kalle@example.com",
  "phone": "070-1234567",
  "city": "Ankeborg"
}

### Sök kund
GET {{host}}/customers?search=Anka
